  "primary": "BRANCHING RATIO s_far + s_near on the settled state, against 1. Damage can only grow if a damaged site infects more than one of its r=2 children in expectation. This decomposes s by WHICH window position is flipped -- the decomposition every earlier measurement averaged over.",
